  'panel-comfyui': ['Window', 'Shows or hides the ComfyUI panel, ComfyUI\'s own page inside the window, with a Save graph bar that keeps the graph ComfyUI ran last as a recipe (new, or replacing one) and reports the nodes and models ComfyUI lacks.', 'Use when you want to work in ComfyUI beside the picture and keep a graph you built there as a recipe; it loads the address in Preferences > Plugins once ComfyUI answers there, and Open in browser is the way out when ComfyUI refuses to be framed.'],
