  'export-layer-comps': ['File','Exports each layer comp to its own file named prefix_NNNN_compname, the flattened document with that comp applied, then puts the document back exactly as it was; opens the dialog, or runs at once when given any of prefix, format, quality, icc or folder.', 'Use when every saved layer comp is needed as a separate image, for design variants or client proofs.', 'r'],
