  'script-delete-empty-layers': ['File', 'Deletes every pixel layer with no visible pixels and every empty group, and says how many; keeps the Background and adjustment, fill, type, shape and smart object layers.', 'Use when a document is cluttered with blank layers and empty folders left from earlier work.', 'm'],
