  'data-sets-import': ['Image', 'Reads data sets from CSV or tab-separated text whose first row names the variables; each later row is one data set. With no text it opens a file chooser for .csv and .txt.', 'Use to load a table of values for variable-driven graphics.'],
  'data-set-apply': ['Image', 'Applies a data set to the document: sets bound layers visible or hidden, replaces bound type text keeping its style, and swaps bound pixel layers, as one undo step.', 'Use to produce one variation of a template from a row of data.'],
  'script-events': ['File', 'Opens the Script Events Manager, where a saved action is bound to an event: the app starting, or a document being made, opened, saved, closed, exported or printed.', 'Use to have an action run by itself whenever one of those events happens.'],
